# Third-party data and models

## Salesforce/xlam-function-calling-60k
Licensed CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Used as a Stage-2 schema-grounding corpus, converted into NTC dataset
examples by `training/tools/convert_xlam.py`. The converted corpus and any
model weights trained on it inherit the attribution requirement.

  Zhang et al., "xLAM: A Family of Large Action Models to Empower AI Agent
  Systems" (Salesforce AI Research), dataset: Salesforce/xlam-function-calling-60k

The source file is NOT redistributed in this repository (it is gated on
Hugging Face); place it at `salesforce-training-data.json` in the repo root.

## sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2
Apache-2.0. Used as the pretrained multilingual backbone (vocabulary pruned
to ~34k for EN/DE/FR/ES by `training/tools/prune_backbone.py`); its
tokenizer is embedded in `contracts/tokenizer-any/tokenizer.json` and in
every `.ntc` model built from it.

## Pimcore agent bundle (pimcore/pimcore-agent-bundle)
Pimcore Open Core License. Only the MCP tool *schemas* are derived, by
`training/tools/extract_pimcore_tools.py` reading the `#[McpTool]` /
`#[Schema]` PHP attributes; no Pimcore source is vendored here.

## Datasets evaluated but not used
- gorilla-llm/APIBench (Apache-2.0) — measured 0.1% of argument values appear
  in the instruction, so it cannot supervise NTC's span-based argument heads.
- glaiveai/glaive-function-calling-v2 (Apache-2.0) — 64% span-alignable, 44%
  no-call records; a candidate for NO_CALL supervision, not yet converted.
- Nexusflow/NexusRaven-V2-13B — model licensed "other" with commercial-use
  restrictions; deliberately not used.
